# thread without UID, so that the response has to report MSNs. expunging
# the first message makes MSN and UID differ, which is the point.
depends thread
send 1
b store 1 +flags (\deleted)
receive 2
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
b OK done
send 1
c expunge
receive 2
* 1 EXPUNGE
c OK done
send 1
d thread orderedsubject ascii all
receive 2
* THREAD (1)(2 11)(3)(4 (6)(18))(5 8)(7 10)(9 12)(13 16)(14 (15)(17)(19))
d OK done
end
